# Code Preservation Rule

## Core Rules

1. Never delete code without explicit request
2. Always use `// ... existing code ...` markers
3. Preserve all initialization code
4. Maintain event listeners
5. Keep state management intact

## Implementation

- Verify all code before changes
- Document intended modifications
- Double-check all deletions
- Test functionality after changes
